{"id":"n90679-1-11","stage":5,"title":"희한하다 · 稀罕","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n90679-1-11-1","ko":"이 먼 곳에서 아는 사람을 만나다니 정말 신기한 일이에요.","zh":"在这么远的地方遇到认识的人，真是件不可思议的事啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"먼","meaning":"远","explanation":"멀다：远；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"멀다","audio":"/audio/e6d01e903c854714b601.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26833","senseId":"1","lemma":"멀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먼","audio":"/audio/a0812217c2f5902295ca.mp3"}},{"text":"곳에서","meaning":"地方，地区","explanation":"곳：地方，地区；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"곳","audio":"/audio/24875f860934407bb8fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18661","senseId":"1","lemma":"곳","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"곳에서","audio":"/audio/6a7245778ca2b0319365.mp3"}},{"text":"아는","meaning":"认识，相识","explanation":"알다：认识，相识；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"10","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아는","audio":"/audio/4ac69e5a586c3d19cbfa.mp3"}},{"text":"사람을","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"1","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람을","audio":"/audio/e4ea86ef494eafea0006.mp3"}},{"text":"만나다니","meaning":"遇见，偶遇，碰到","explanation":"만나다：遇见，偶遇，碰到；다니：对得知的内容表示惊讶、感叹，并连接后文。","readings":[{"term":"만나다","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66591","senseId":"4","lemma":"만나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"만나다니","audio":"/audio/6ee4406570a1aaefcca2.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的。","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61174","senseId":"1","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"신기한","meaning":"新奇，神奇","explanation":"신기하다：新奇，神奇；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"신기하다","audio":"/audio/b97b3c0972748f91d896.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"13998","senseId":"1","lemma":"신기하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"신기한","audio":"/audio/8b5044ad63a442461077.mp3"}},{"text":"일이에요.","meaning":"事，事情","explanation":"일：事，事情；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；에요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"3","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일이에요","audio":"/audio/55384f279634ae46dc2f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"e6d01e903c854714","term":"멀다","zh":"远","audio":"/audio/e6d01e903c854714b601.mp3","entryId":"26833","definition":"两地之间的距离长。","pronunciation":["멀ː다"]},{"id":"24875f860934407b","term":"곳","zh":"地方，地区","audio":"/audio/24875f860934407bb8fb.mp3","entryId":"18661","definition":"一个特定的地点或位置。","pronunciation":["곧"]},{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"认识，相识","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"以前见过，或有过交流而亲密往来。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"可以思考，会制造并使用语言和工具、构成社会而生活的存在。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"b1bced847edb7e2e","term":"만나다","zh":"遇见，偶遇，碰到","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3","entryId":"66591","definition":"在去往某地的途中，偶然碰到某人。","pronunciation":["만나다"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61174","definition":"没有虚假而真正地。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"b97b3c0972748f91","term":"신기하다","zh":"新奇，神奇","audio":"/audio/b97b3c0972748f91d896.mp3","entryId":"13998","definition":"由于第一次看见而感到新鲜奇特。","pronunciation":["신기하다"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事，事情","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"带有某种内容的情况或事实。","pronunciation":["일ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/00f3f34225084699157a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n90679-1-11-2","ko":"네, 그것 참 희한한 일이네요.","zh":"是啊，这确实是很奇怪的事呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，是的，哎","explanation":"네：是，是的，哎。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"1","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"그것","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그것：那个。","readings":[{"term":"그것","audio":"/audio/49ef044188dcd25ecf37.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31953","senseId":"2","lemma":"그것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그것","audio":"/audio/49ef044188dcd25ecf37.mp3"}},{"text":"참","meaning":"真，实在，的确","explanation":"참：真，实在，的确。","readings":[{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71761","senseId":"1","lemma":"참","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}},{"text":"희한한","meaning":"稀罕，稀奇","explanation":"희한하다：稀罕，稀奇；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"희한하다","audio":"/audio/bf6596c2862338b34bb9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"90679","senseId":"1","lemma":"희한하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"